h?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Sewers_KoboldTreasureNote04\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Sewers_KoboldTreasureNote04\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">39195313-b7f2-4f1e-a1dc-a180bbd641df</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:39195313-b7f2-4f1e-a1dc-a180bbd641df\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:39195313-b7f2-4f1e-a1dc-a180bbd641df\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a trapped, buried chest marked with a crown at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-175&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;858</span> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City_Sewers\" title=\"Lower City Sewers\">Lower City Sewers</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Keep looking, cank. Going real well for you, isn't it?\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scrawled_Note_(Sewers,_coin)\" title=\"Scrawled Note (Sewers, coin)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scrawled_Note_(Sewers,_coin)\" title=\"Scrawled Note (Sewers, coin)\">Scrawled Note (Sewers, coin)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scrawled_Note_(Sewers,_gem)\" title=\"Scrawled Note (Sewers, gem)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scrawled_Note_(Sewers,_gem)\" title=\"Scrawled Note (Sewers, gem)\">Scrawled Note (Sewers, gem)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scrawled_Note_(Sewers,_sword)\" title=\"Scrawled Note (Sewers, sword)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scrawled_Note_(Sewers,_sword)\" title=\"Scrawled Note (Sewers, sword)\">Scrawled Note (Sewers, sword)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>\"Cank\" is a rare, dialectal English word with meanings like gossip, chatter, or a tell-tale, also referring to a fit of ill-humor or the cry of a goose; historically, it meant someone who would not confess: a \"rogue's dumb\".\n<ul><li>A \"rogue's dumb\" is historical slang from the 17th-19th centuries, meaning \"dumb\" in the sense of refusing to speak or confess during questioning, used by criminals (the \"canting crew\") to describe a member who stayed silent when caught, preventing betrayal of their fellows.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202746\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2430/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32682/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9035/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.025/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1195814/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   59.177      1 -total\n 98.67%   58.391      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 34.36%   20.334     31 Template:Trim